# Keep every checked-out text file byte-identical to its blob.
#
# Without this, `core.autocrlf` decides per machine, and a file can carry a
# CRLF in the working tree that git hides from `git status` — so `npm publish`
# packs bytes the repository never had. That divergence is invisible to every
# command except a byte-level pack comparison (RELEASE.md, "内容同源核对").
* text=auto eol=lf
